<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-HEWITT AND JONES INCLUDED IN BARBARIANS' SIDE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-HEWITT AND JONES INCLUDED IN BARBARIANS' SIDE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand forwards Norm Hewitt and Ian Jones have been included in the Barbarians' side to meet Australia at Twickenham on December 7.</p>
<p>Former England backs Rob Andrew and  Tony Underwood were also picked in the side named on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
